  "passage": {
    "text": "Every warehouse needs a good team. A team leader organizes the shifts, so there are always enough workers. Some people work in the morning and some work at night. New workers get training before they start. The leader teaches them the safety rules and shows them the machines. Every week the leader holds a short meeting. The workers can ask questions and say their ideas. The leader also measures the results, for example how many orders the team packs in an hour. When the team does well, the leader says thank you. Happy workers stay longer in the company.",
